SUMMARY: for the multiset {0,1,1} (free vs transverse polarization at k=(0,1,1)2pi/L) the angular difference D is exactly -119/450 at L=2 (landed prior art), is not symmetry-forced to vanish, and seed-level estimates give L=4: -0.0009+-0.0005 (EQUIVALENT at margin 0.005), L=6: +0.0020+-0.0012 (EQUIVALENT at margin 0.005), L=8: +0.0004+-0.0014 (EQUIVALENT at margin 0.005), with tau_int ~ 1.5 loops so the error model is sound but the sampling precision does not reach 0.05 %.
